/P 48 0 R
/T (Scalp microbes A mixed consortia of bacteria and yeast was created to mimic a simplifi ed scalp microbiome. This consortium included C.acnes, S. epidermidis, C.striatum and M.globosa. These microbes were se- lected based on published data and in house data from 16SRNA sequenced scalp microbiome swabs \(10\).)
/E (Scalp microbes A mixed consortia of bacteria and yeast was created to mimic a simplifi ed scalp microbiome. This consortium included C.acnes, S. epidermidis, C.striatum and M.globosa. These microbes were se- lected based on published data and in house data from 16SRNA sequenced scalp microbiome swabs \(10\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [22]
>>
